WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.265
On a number line, how many unit intervals are between 1 and 6? Let us think

00:00:05.265 --> 00:00:09.697
carefully. Subtract the starting point from the end point. The answer is 5. Great

00:00:09.697 --> 00:00:10.013
work!

